// ────────────── Output Configuration ──────────────
// Run `niri msg outputs` for the names.
// https://github.com/YaLTeR/niri/wiki/Configuration:-Outputs
//
// Deliberately empty of output blocks. Monique owns all of them, in
// monitors.kdl, which config.kdl includes after this file — and niri does NOT
// merge two blocks for the same output. The later one replaces the earlier
// wholesale.
//
// That was measured rather than assumed: an output block here for the laptop
// panel, carrying nothing but a variable-refresh-rate line, moved it from
// Monique's x=2409 y=-84 to x=0 y=0. Anything added here silently discards the
// mode, scale and position Monique wrote.
//
// Per-output settings therefore belong in the Monique profile under
// desktop/niri/.config/monique/profiles/, which regenerates monitors.kdl with
// every field together. The Acer's VRR is set there — see the gaming section
// of the README for what Monique does and does not emit for niri.
